; BQ40Z50 Current Calibration Sequence

; 1. Enter CAL mode
W 0x00 0x002D
X 170

; 2. Check CAL_EN 1
CHK_CAL 1

; 3. Raw ADC MODE start
W 0x00 0xF081
X 230

; 4. Read Raw ADC 6 times (200ms apart)
A 0x44 200 6
X 10

; 5. Raw ADC MODE stop
W 0x00 0xF080
X 160

; 6. Save Current Calibration Data (updates 0x4000 block)
S 0x4000
X 250

; 7. Raw ADC MODE stop (again)
W 0x00 0xF080
X 60

; 8. Disable CAL mode
W 0x00 0x002D
X 60

; 9. Check CAL_EN 0
CHK_CAL 0
